# Claude Code tooling — stays out of the submission.
# .mcp.json and .claude/settings.json carry absolute paths from the machine they were
# generated on, plus hooks that call a `framework` binary this repository no longer
# depends on. The skills under .claude/skills/ are third-party content, not this
# project's work. CLAUDE.md is kept: it documents the invariants, and it is ours.
.claude/
.mcp.json
